                  <p>26  Application and transitional provisions</p>
                </content>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-25__subsec-1">
                  <num>1</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>(1)	In working out on or after the commencement of this item whether a person is an athlete for the purposes of the <i>Sport Integrity Australia Act 2020</i>,<i> </i>or regulations under that Act, on the basis of the person having at any time in the last 6 months competed in sport, disregard any competing in sport that occurred before that commencement.</p>
                  </content>
